		EmptyName: (vacant)
		EmptyHintNakago: The tang bears no name — this slot sits empty, granting no boon and charging no price. Pick a chisel print and cut one in; that is what gives the blade its temper
		EmptyHintHi: No groove opened. Each groove cut is a measure of weight gone
		EmptyHintHorimono: The carving bed sits empty, granting nothing. Decide which one you would invite into the steel, then pick its chisel print and set to work
		EraseName: EFFACE
		EraseHint: File this inscription away — a mei can be cut again, but the blade forgets no scar
		OriginLabel: Provenance
		PowerLabel: Bestowal
		BurdenLabel: Price
		CurrentMark: Present
		GoldMark: Gold Inlay
		SigilTabText: Sigil Wheel
		SigilTabHint: Click to step over
		TrayTitle: Satchel Rubbings
		TrayEmpty: No rubbing for this seat in your satchel. Fan ribs of owned mei still carve
		CodexTabText: Mei Codex
		CodexTabHint: Click to open
	}

