	KikasaHudLead: {
		DomainTitle: Expand the Blood Lake
		DomainBody: The Blood Lake is Kikasa's core domain. Storing items, drowning foes, and commanding shades all require the Blood Lake to be expanded and its water raised. Hold the Kikasa: Command the Tide key (X by default) to freely adjust the water level to your cursor.
		DomainPrompt: Hold Kikasa and press {0} to expand the domain
		SinkTitle: Sinking & Drowning
		SinkBody: Press the Kikasa: Sink Something key while holding an item to store it in the lakebed vault (reclaimable in the Lakeheart). Press the same key while aiming at an enemy to drown it. Drowned bosses turn into shades that can be assigned to fight alongside you.
		SinkPrompt: Wait for the Blood Lake to fill completely, then press {0} holding an item or aiming at an enemy
		PanoramaTitle: Open the Lakeheart
		PanoramaBody: The Lakeheart is Kikasa's management interface: the top controls the hounds and ghost fire, the middle has 3 seats for organizing active shades, and the bottom is the lakebed vault for stored items. Click the raincall rope to hang talismans.
		PanoramaPrompt: Click the wind chime at the bottom-left, or hold Kikasa and press {0}
		WheelTitle: Shade Wheel
		WheelBody: Shades assigned to seats automatically fight when the Blood Lake is expanded. Hold the wheel key anytime in combat to individually summon or recall shades: the fewer afield, the higher each one's damage. The gold flame option on the wheel lights or extinguishes the ghost fire that burns enemies.
		WheelPrompt: Hold {0} to open the wheel, aim at a seat, and release
		WheelNoMemory: No shades recorded in the lake yet. Drown a boss first, or click Skip.
		RainTitle: Flip to Ghost Rain
		RainBody: At full water, tap the Kikasa: Flip the Lake key (middle mouse by default) to flip the Blood Lake into Ghost Rain. Regular enemies slain under the ghost rain are converted into umbrella thralls that fight for you. Long-pressing this key enters the Ghost Dream.
		RainPrompt: At full water, tap {0} to flip into Ghost Rain
		RestartTitle: Wide Restart
		RestartBody: Press the Self-Restart key to rewind yourself and all nearby enemies to their positions seconds ago. You are completely invulnerable during the rewind, health is fully restored, and all debuffs are cleansed. It can be triggered anytime even outside ghost rain, and returns to your previous domain state after finishing.
		RestartPrompt: Hold Kikasa and press {0} to trigger restart
		DreamTitle: Enter the Ghost Dream
		DreamBody: At full water, hold the Kikasa: Flip the Lake key to enter the Ghost Dream. Enemies inside are paralyzed and ranged projectiles cannot exist. Normal items cannot be used; hold left-click to continuously summon hounds that tear at enemies (bites ignore armor). Press the key again to wake and exit the dream.
		DreamPrompt: At full water, hold {0} to enter the Ghost Dream
		CloseTitle: Draw Back the Blood Lake
		CloseBody: Once expanded, the Blood Lake continuously follows you and will not disappear when switching weapons. Hold Kikasa and press the Domain Expansion key again to close the domain. All stored vault items, shades, and drowning records remain permanently saved in the umbrella for next time.
		ClosePrompt: Hold Kikasa and press {0} to close the Blood Lake
		CloseInDreamNote: You are still in the Ghost Dream. Press {0} to exit the dream first, then close the domain.
		CloseSettlingNote: The domain is transitioning between forms, please wait.
		KeyUnboundFallback: Key "{0}" is not bound. You can temporarily press {1} for this step; bind it in Settings > Controls for regular use.
		ShieldNote: Protected during tutorial: enemies cannot harm you, and no enemies will spawn nearby.
		SkipBtn: Skip
		ConfirmBtn: Got it
		AssistBtn: Show me
		OpenPanoramaBtn: Open it for me
		DismissBtn: Put away
		KeyUnbound: Key "{0}" required for this step is not bound. Please bind it in Settings > Controls, or click Skip.
		AlreadyDoneNote: You have already completed this step. Read through and click Got it to continue.
		WaterRisingNote: Waiting for the Blood Lake to fill completely. Current level: {0}%.
		ResetCooldownFormat: Restart still cooling down: {0}%
		HelpHover: Replay the Kikasa tutorial
		MutateFallbackKey: middle mouse
	}
}
